{"openapi":"3.0.0","info":{"title":"Zero-Knowledge E2EE Social Engine","version":"1.0.0","description":"Complete API Documentation for the End-to-End Encrypted Social & Chat Backend.\n\n## Architecture\n- **REST API** for CRUD operations (auth, users, groups, posts, comments, moods)\n- **Socket.IO** for real-time messaging, typing indicators, presence, and offline queue sync\n- **E2EE**: All message/post/comment content is encrypted client-side; backend is zero-knowledge\n\n## Authentication\nAll REST endpoints require a **JWT Bearer token** (obtained from `/api/auth/login`).\nSocket.IO connections authenticate via `handshake.auth.token` (or `?token=...` query).\n\n## Socket.IO Quick Start\n```js\nconst { io } = require('socket.io-client');\nconst socket = io('http://localhost:5000', { auth: { token: '<JWT>' } });\nsocket.on('connect', () => console.log('Connected'));\nsocket.on('connect_error', (err) => console.error('Auth failed:', err.message));\n```\n\n👉 See the **Socket.IO Events** tag for the full event reference table.","contact":{"name":"API Support"}},"servers":[{"url":"http://localhost:5000","description":"Development Server"}],"components":{"securitySchemes":{"BearerAuth":{"type":"http","scheme":"bearer","bearerFormat":"JWT","description":"Enter your Access Token (without \"Bearer\" prefix)"}},"schemas":{"ErrorResponse":{"type":"object","required":["status","message"],"properties":{"status":{"type":"string","example":"error"},"message":{"type":"string","example":"Something went wrong"}}},"SuccessResponse":{"type":"object","properties":{"status":{"type":"string","example":"success"},"data":{"type":"object"}}},"UserProfile":{"type":"object","properties":{"_id":{"type":"string","example":"64f1a2b3c4d5e6f7a8b9c0d1"},"name":{"type":"string","example":"Yousuf Ahmed"},"username":{"type":"string","example":"yousuf_dev"},"email":{"type":"string","format":"email","example":"yousuf@test.com"},"avatarUrl":{"type":"string","example":"https://res.cloudinary.com/..."},"bio":{"type":"string","example":"Full-stack dev"},"publicKey":{"type":"string","nullable":true,"example":"-----BEGIN PUBLIC KEY-----..."},"isPrivate":{"type":"boolean","example":false},"isProfileLocked":{"type":"boolean","example":false},"friends":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"},"description":"Array of user IDs"},"friendRequests":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"}},"blockedUsers":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"}},"mutedUsers":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"}},"mutedGroups":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"}},"lastSeen":{"type":"string","format":"date-time"},"createdAt":{"type":"string","format":"date-time"},"updatedAt":{"type":"string","format":"date-time"}}},"PublicUserSummary":{"type":"object","description":"Limited user info returned in search results / friend lists","properties":{"_id":{"type":"string"},"name":{"type":"string"},"username":{"type":"string"},"avatarUrl":{"type":"string"},"bio":{"type":"string"}}},"LockedUserSummary":{"type":"object","description":"Returned when profile is locked and requester is not a friend","properties":{"_id":{"type":"string"},"name":{"type":"string"},"username":{"type":"string"},"avatarUrl":{"type":"string"},"isProfileLocked":{"type":"boolean","example":true}}},"Message":{"type":"object","properties":{"_id":{"type":"string"},"sender":{"type":"string"},"receiver":{"type":"string","nullable":true},"group":{"type":"string","nullable":true},"content":{"type":"string","description":"E2EE ciphertext or Cloudinary URL"},"messageType":{"type":"string","enum":["text","image","video"]},"isDisappearing":{"type":"boolean"},"timerInSeconds":{"type":"number"},"seenBy":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"}},"reactions":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","properties":{"user":{"type":"string"},"reactionType":{"type":"string"}}}},"createdAt":{"type":"string","format":"date-time"}}},"Group":{"type":"object","properties":{"_id":{"type":"string"},"groupName":{"type":"string"},"groupIcon":{"type":"string"},"creator":{"type":"string"},"members":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"}},"encryptedGroupKeys":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","properties":{"user":{"type":"string"},"encryptedKey":{"type":"string"}}}},"createdAt":{"type":"string","format":"date-time"}}},"Post":{"type":"object","properties":{"_id":{"type":"string"},"author":{"type":"string"},"textContent":{"type":"string","description":"E2EE ciphertext"},"mediaUrl":{"type":"string","nullable":true},"mediaType":{"type":"string","enum":["image","video","none"]},"visibility":{"type":"string","enum":["public","friends"]},"reactions":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object"}},"createdAt":{"type":"string","format":"date-time"}}},"Comment":{"type":"object","properties":{"_id":{"type":"string"},"post":{"type":"string"},"author":{"type":"string"},"textContent":{"type":"string"},"parentId":{"type":"string","nullable":true},"createdAt":{"type":"string","format":"date-time"}}},"MoodLog":{"type":"object","properties":{"_id":{"type":"string"},"user":{"type":"string"},"currentMood":{"type":"string","enum":["Happy","Sad","Angry","Missing You"]},"date":{"type":"string","format":"date"},"createdAt":{"type":"string","format":"date-time"}}},"AuthResponse":{"type":"object","properties":{"status":{"type":"string","example":"success"},"data":{"type":"object","properties":{"user":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/UserProfile"},"token":{"type":"string","description":"JWT Access Token (15m-1h expiry)","example":"eyJhbGciOi..."},"refreshToken":{"type":"string","description":"Long-lived refresh token (7-30 days)","example":"eyJhbGciOi..."}}}}},"RefreshTokenResponse":{"type":"object","properties":{"status":{"type":"string","example":"success"},"data":{"type":"object","properties":{"token":{"type":"string","description":"New Access Token"}}}}},"RegisterRequest":{"type":"object","required":["name","username","email","password"],"properties":{"name":{"type":"string","example":"Yousuf Ahmed"},"username":{"type":"string","example":"yousuf_dev"},"email":{"type":"string","format":"email","example":"yousuf@test.com"},"password":{"type":"string","format":"password","example":"password123"},"publicKey":{"type":"string","example":"-----BEGIN PUBLIC KEY-----..."}}},"LoginRequest":{"type":"object","required":["loginId","password"],"properties":{"loginId":{"type":"string","description":"Email or Username","example":"yousuf_dev"},"password":{"type":"string","format":"password","example":"password123"}}},"SupabaseLoginRequest":{"type":"object","required":["accessToken"],"properties":{"accessToken":{"type":"string","example":"supabase_access_token_here"},"publicKey":{"type":"string","example":"-----BEGIN PUBLIC KEY-----..."}}},"RefreshTokenRequest":{"type":"object","required":["refreshToken"],"properties":{"refreshToken":{"type":"string","example":"eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..."}}},"CryptoVaultRestoreRequest":{"type":"object","required":["backupPin"],"properties":{"backupPin":{"type":"string","example":"123456"}}},"UpdatePasswordRequest":{"type":"object","required":["oldPassword","newPassword"],"properties":{"oldPassword":{"type":"string","format":"password","example":"password123"},"newPassword":{"type":"string","format":"password","example":"newPassword123"}}},"UpdateProfileRequest":{"type":"object","properties":{"name":{"type":"string","example":"Updated Name"},"bio":{"type":"string","example":"My new bio"},"avatarUrl":{"type":"string","example":"https://res.cloudinary.com/..."},"isPrivate":{"type":"boolean","example":false},"publicKey":{"type":"string","example":"-----BEGIN PUBLIC KEY-----..."},"fcmToken":{"type":"string","example":"dummy_fcm_token"}}},"SendMessageRequest":{"type":"object","required":["content"],"properties":{"receiverId":{"type":"string","description":"For 1-to-1 chat","example":"64f1a2b3c4d5e6f7a8b9c0d1"},"groupId":{"type":"string","description":"For group chat","example":"64f1a2b3c4d5e6f7a8b9c0d2"},"messageType":{"type":"string","enum":["text","image","video"],"example":"text"},"content":{"type":"string","description":"E2EE Ciphertext or Cloudinary URL","example":"U2FsdGVkX1..."},"isDisappearing":{"type":"boolean","example":false},"timerInSeconds":{"type":"number","example":0},"mediaPublicId":{"type":"string","example":"dummy_public_id"}}},"ForwardMessageRequest":{"type":"object","required":["messageId"],"properties":{"messageId":{"type":"string","example":"64f1a2b3c4d5e6f7a8b9c0d5"},"receiverId":{"type":"string","example":"64f1a2b3c4d5e6f7a8b9c0d1"},"groupId":{"type":"string","example":"64f1a2b3c4d5e6f7a8b9c0d2"},"isDisappearing":{"type":"boolean","example":false},"timerInSeconds":{"type":"number","example":0}}},"BulkDeleteRequest":{"type":"object","required":["messageIds"],"properties":{"messageIds":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"},"example":["64f1a2b3c4d5e6f7a8b9c0d6"]}}},"CreatePostRequest":{"type":"object","properties":{"textContent":{"type":"string","example":"U2FsdGVkX1...encrypted_blob"},"mediaUrl":{"type":"string","example":"https://res.cloudinary.com/..."},"mediaType":{"type":"string","enum":["image","video","none"],"example":"none"},"visibility":{"type":"string","enum":["public","friends"],"example":"public"},"mediaPublicId":{"type":"string","example":"dummy_public_id"}}},"CreateCommentRequest":{"type":"object","required":["textContent"],"properties":{"textContent":{"type":"string","example":"U2FsdGVkX1...encrypted_comment"},"parentId":{"type":"string","description":"For nested reply","example":"64f1a2b3c4d5e6f7a8b9c0d3"}}},"CreateGroupRequest":{"type":"object","required":["groupName"],"properties":{"groupName":{"type":"string","example":"MERN Stack Team"},"groupIcon":{"type":"string","example":"https://res.cloudinary.com/..."},"members":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"},"example":["64f1a2b3c4d5e6f7a8b9c0d1"]},"encryptedGroupKeys":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","properties":{"user":{"type":"string"},"encryptedKey":{"type":"string"}}}}}},"EditGroupRequest":{"type":"object","properties":{"groupName":{"type":"string","example":"Updated Team Name"},"groupIcon":{"type":"string","example":"https://res.cloudinary.com/new-icon.png"}}},"AddGroupMemberRequest":{"type":"object","required":["memberId"],"properties":{"memberId":{"type":"string","example":"64f1a2b3c4d5e6f7a8b9c0d4"}}},"RotateKeysRequest":{"type":"object","required":["encryptedGroupKeys"],"properties":{"encryptedGroupKeys":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","properties":{"user":{"type":"string"},"encryptedKey":{"type":"string"}}}}}},"SocketInstantMessagePayload":{"type":"object","required":["messagePayload"],"properties":{"receiverId":{"type":"string","description":"For 1-to-1 message (required if groupId absent)"},"groupId":{"type":"string","description":"For group message (required if receiverId absent)"},"messagePayload":{"type":"object","properties":{"content":{"type":"string","description":"E2EE ciphertext"},"messageType":{"type":"string","enum":["text","image","video"]},"isDisappearing":{"type":"boolean"},"timerInSeconds":{"type":"number"},"mediaPublicId":{"type":"string"}}}}},"SocketOfflineEvent":{"type":"object","properties":{"event":{"type":"string","example":"receive-message"},"payload":{"type":"object","description":"Event-specific payload"}}}}},"tags":[{"name":"Auth","description":"Authentication & Security Endpoints"},{"name":"User","description":"User & Profile Management"},{"name":"Social","description":"Friend Request, Privacy, Block, Mute"},{"name":"Messaging","description":"E2EE Real-Time Chat (REST persistence)"},{"name":"Socket.IO Events","description":"## Real-time Socket.IO Events\n\n**Note:** Socket.IO does not use HTTP paths. This tag documents every event in a machine-readable form.\n\n### 🔌 Connection\n```js\nconst socket = io('http://localhost:5000', {\n  auth: { token: '<JWT_ACCESS_TOKEN>' },  // or ?token=<JWT>\n  transports: ['websocket'],\n});\n```\n\n### 🔐 Auth & Rate Limits\n- JWT verified in `io.use` middleware\n- `tokenVersion` must match user record (logout revokes sockets)\n- **Max 5 connections per IP**\n- **Max 50 queued offline messages per user**\n\n### 📤 Client → Server Events\n\n| Event | Payload | Notes |\n|-------|---------|-------|\n| `join-group` | `groupId: string` | Must be a member of the group |\n| `typing` | `{ receiverId: string }` | Ignored if receiver blocked sender |\n| `stop-typing` | `{ receiverId: string }` | |\n| `group-typing` | `{ groupId: string }` | Broadcast to group room |\n| `group-stop-typing` | `{ groupId: string }` | Broadcast to group room |\n| `instant-message` | `{ receiverId?: string, groupId?: string, messagePayload: object }` | If receiver offline → queued (max 50) |\n\n### 📥 Server → Client Events\n\n| Event | Payload | Notes |\n|-------|---------|-------|\n| `connect` | — | Successful connection |\n| `connect_error` | `Error` | Auth failed (message: \"Authentication error\") |\n| `force-logout` | `{ message: string }` | Logged in from another device |\n| `sync-offline-events` | `Array<{ event: string, payload: object }>` | Emitted immediately on connect if queue non-empty |\n| `online-status` | `{ userId: string, isOnline: boolean, lastSeen?: ISO8601 }` | Broadcast to friends |\n| `typing` | `{ senderId: string, isTyping: boolean }` | |\n| `group-typing` | `{ senderId: string, groupId: string, isTyping: boolean }` | |\n| `receive-message` | `messagePayload` | 1-to-1 message |\n| `receive-group-message` | `messagePayload` | Group message |\n\n### 🚪 Rooms\n- Every user auto-joins a private room named **their userId**\n- Users join group rooms explicitly via `join-group` after membership check\n\n### 💡 Typical Client Flow\n```js\nsocket.on('receive-message', (msg) => { /* decrypt + render */ });\nsocket.on('sync-offline-events', (events) => {\n  // Replay missed messages on reconnect\n  events.forEach(({ event, payload }) => handle(event, payload));\n});\nsocket.emit('instant-message', {\n  receiverId: '...',\n  messagePayload: { content: '<cipher>', messageType: 'text' },\n});\n```"},{"name":"Groups","description":"Group Management & E2EE Key Rotation"},{"name":"Posts","description":"Social Feed & Content"},{"name":"Comments","description":"Nested Comment System"},{"name":"Moods","description":"Daily Mood Tracking"},{"name":"Media","description":"Cloudinary Secure Uploads"}],"paths":{"/socket.io":{"get":{"tags":["Socket.IO Events"],"summary":"Socket.IO WebSocket Connection (pseudo-endpoint)","description":"⚠️ **This is NOT an HTTP endpoint.** It exists so AI/codegen tools can discover the socket contract.\n\nConnect using a Socket.IO client, not `fetch()`.\n\n**Required:** valid JWT in `auth.token` or `?token=<jwt>` query parameter.\n\nSee the **Socket.IO Events** tag description for the complete client↔server event reference table.","parameters":[{"name":"token","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string"},"description":"JWT (alternative to auth.token)"}],"responses":{"101":{"description":"WebSocket upgrade successful"},"401":{"description":"Auth failed — invalid token, expired session (tokenVersion mismatch), or IP limit exceeded"}}}},"/api/auth/register":{"post":{"tags":["Auth"],"summary":"Register a new user","requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/RegisterRequest"}}}},"responses":{"201":{"description":"User registered","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/AuthResponse"}}}},"400":{"description":"Validation failed or disposable email","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"}}}},"409":{"description":"Duplicate email or username","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"}}}}}}},"/api/auth/login":{"post":{"tags":["Auth"],"summary":"Login with email or username","requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/LoginRequest"}}}},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Returns Access + Refresh Tokens","cont